        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha Hobabu, orjeeda Reueli was siida Midiyani, agweaji Musa, “Aseasa geeweayi ng'eanyiida ayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘gaydagooneegwa’; beeni eeteayeena ak gajeesineey ng'asheega miyaas; aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA gaydaadaw Israeli ng'asheega miyaas.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda niny ak gwayeesha, “Aniini maydawa; aniini gaydabiikta ng'eanyiideanyu ea heeda buweadeegeasu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Musa, “Geemuscheey adinung'useasa heeda, aba gideaba ginali gichea eepideata aba dareapcheeda, ak aba heedeanya gajuna hoorgeeda gheanyangaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama siiteayi sea ang'iing'i, gida wassean miy jea gwasinneasa NG'UTAMIIDA, abeeda gajeesineey eara aseasa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat ng'eayda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabalaga giijeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gaweay eawooji samwagu; nea goosheedeawa sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA aba beata eawooji samwagu, nea gagasa ng'eanyiida jea gafuufa saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda gwanda shamooghooda NG'UTAMIIDA iheenga nyaawa askweari, Iinyo gabalaga museasooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
